{"entryId":"2262","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:2262:1","sourceSha256":"aa836a2a4208d39803ddf029a6491589069808aecf7682397f45652791588591","englishSha256":"843bfa86b863eea60026672665aec83d1ad15e57b8c4a499302b228129e406ae","citations":[{"id":"2262:1:link-01","he":[246,261],"en":[387,401],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.3"},"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:3","assessment":"The named witness and the egg’s sixty cities are present. The checked Bavli reads sixteen wagons, while Heilprin reads seventeen. The omasum and leaflike layers are part of the cited text and its glosses.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"2262:1:link-02","he":[63,76],"en":[75,100],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bekhorot_57b.3.1"},"reference":"Rashi on Bekhorot 57b:3:1","assessment":"Rashi glosses Arkat Livna as a place name.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rashi on Bekhorot 57b:3:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bekhorot_57b.3.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"2262:1:link-03","he":[20,49],"en":[24,54],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Nach_926.2"},"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni on Nach 926:2","assessment":"The Job witness at remez 926 gives Satriel and explicitly includes the gnat. The parallel in Yalkut on Leviticus at remez 681 reads Katriel and includes the same gnat report. Retain Heilprin’s witness attribution in the translation and document the split.","evidence":[{"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni on Nach 926:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Nach_926.2"},"witness":"Yalkut Shimoni on Nach"},{"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni on Torah 681:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Yalkut_Shimoni_on_Torah_681.1"},"witness":"Torat Emet"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[2,1,0],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"The named witness and the egg’s sixty cities are present. The checked Bavli reads sixteen wagons, while Heilprin reads seventeen. The omasum and leaflike layers are part of the cited text and its glosses.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"Rashi glosses Arkat Livna as a place name.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"Rashi reads חזירין as the name of the lettuce plant and separately explains the leaves in an animal’s omasum. Read the difficult juxtaposition in Heilprin against distinct witnesses and avoid harmonizing the details.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"The Job witness at remez 926 gives Satriel and explicitly includes the gnat. The parallel in Yalkut on Leviticus at remez 681 reads Katriel and includes the same gnat report. Retain Heilprin’s witness attribution in the translation and document the split.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.3"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Bekhorot 57b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bekhorot_57b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rashi on Bekhorot 57b:3:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bekhorot_57b.3.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rashi on Bekhorot 57b:4:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bekhorot_57b.4.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Rashi on Bekhorot 57b:4:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rashi_on_Bekhorot_57b.4.2"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Yalkut Shimoni on Na